18B\u2019 \u2013 Pallehewanile Kumbura alias Duranile Kumbura\n\nGalbokka \u2013 Extent: 0.0414 Hectare\n\nNorth: Lot A and Pallehewanile Kumbura claimed by M. T. G.\n\nDhanapala alias Duranile Kumbura Galbokka; East: Pallehewanile"
