    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'23PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 23.09.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2142$4 \u2013 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 23 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'09'23No. 2142/4 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 23, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 31041 \u2013 56 (09/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary\n\nReforms do hereby give declaration that under Sub-Section (1) ofsection 5 of the Land Acquisition Act that the land morefullydescribed below is required for a public purpose and will be acquiredunder the Provision of the Land Acquisition Act.\n\nThe allotments of land and extent under the following namesmorefully shown in the Advanced Tracing No. PO/ELH/2016/200\n\n(amended) dated 15.05.2018 prepared by the Surveyor - Genaral,located in the village of Attaragallewa in the Sinhala Pattuwa MinorDivision in the Elahera Divisional Secretary's Division in the Districtof Polonnaruwa in the North Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 - Attaragallewa Kele - Extent: 0.0705 HectareNorth:Road and chena claimed by Hewayalage Sugath SisiraKumara; East: Chena claimed by Hewayalage Sugath Sisira Kumara;South: Chena claimed by Kankanam Gamage Piyasena, Lot B andElahera - Giritale Forest Reservation; West: Elahera - Giritale ForestReservation."
