    "chunk_text": "wxl 2142$13 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'24No. 2142/13 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 24, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 31047 - 12 (09/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: MO/ED/03/ACQ/20.\n\nLand Min. No. : 4/3/4/2014/L O/431.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following land which is required for a Police SuperintendOffice of Moneragala.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nAllotments of Land in F.V.P. 172, Supplement No. 409, SheetNo. 450 prepared by the superintend surveyor in Monaragala,situated in Muppane Village in the Moneragala DivisionalSecretary's Division of the District of Monaragala in UvaProvince described as follows :\n\n01. Lot No. 4035Name of the land: Kumarawattha; Claimant: Land reformcommission; Extent: 0.2860 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 4036Name of the land: Kumarawattha; Claimant: Land ReformCommission; Extent: 0.1290 Hectare.\n\nAll Persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyagents duly authorized in writing, before me at MoneragalaDivisional Secretariat on the 29th day of October, 2019 at 10.00a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (induplicate) on or before the 15th day of October, 2019 the natureof their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the said land the amount of compensationand the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nK. PRAGEETH KULATHILAKA,Divisional Secretary,Moneragala.\n\nDivisional Secretariat,Moneragala,12th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 263\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
