rict of\n\nWestern Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 4 \u2013 Parts of Assmt. Nos. 430/5, 432, 434 and 436,\n\nSunethradevi Road \u2013 Extent: About 0.0006 Hectare."
