    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'24Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2142$43 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'24No. 2142/43 - TUESDAY SEPTEMBER 24, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE BATTICALOA MUNICIPALCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Batticaloa Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of being ceased tobe a member of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Tamil United Liberation Front, the recognized political party to whichVeluppillai Gangeswary the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, todecide upon returned member of Tamil United Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a periodof thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Varneswary Ravichandran to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Rajendra Saseelan, Returning Officer of the Batticaloa Municipal Council, acting interms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that VarneswaryRavichandran was selected as the member of the Batticaloa Municipal Council.\n\nR. SASEELAN,Returning Officer,Batticaloa Municipal Council.District Election Office,Batticaloa,24th September, 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
