    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'25PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 25.09.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2142$64 \u2013 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 25 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'09'25No. 2142/64 \u2013 WENESDAY, SEPTEMBER 25, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 31094 \u2013 56 (09/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 38(a)\n\nOrder No. 182 of 2019\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/3/2018/NRD/89.Divisional Secretary's. Ref No.: DIVIB/LND/LADAQ/03/KHRW/20.\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) of Section 38Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands & Parliamentary Reforms do hereby direct theAcquiring Officer or any other officer authorized by him referred toin Columm 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of theland specified in the corresponding entry in Columm II of that Schedule.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.16 September, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Land Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Ibbagamuwa.\n\n2. Description of the land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted in theAdvance Tracing No. Ma/GLW/2018/360 dated 26.04.2019prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village calledUdawela in the Udaawela Grama Niladhari Division No. 518 in theDivisional Secretary' s Division of Ibbagamuwa in Kurunegala Districtin North Western province and boundaries as follows."
