    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2142/71 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 26 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.26\n\nNo. 2142/71 \u2013 THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 26, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n02. Lot No. 04 Name of the land: -; Present Land Use: Road; Claimant: State; Original claimant: Not known; Extent: 0.0297 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 07 Name of the land: Diyawanna Kumbura, Assessment No. 58/6, Pasal Mawatha; Present Land Use: Home garden, temporary house; Claimant: State; Original claimant: M.N.M. Bandarathilaka, No.488, Nawala Road, Rajagiriya, T.K. Premadasa, No.58/6E, Pasal Mawatha, Nawala Road, Rajagiriya; Extent: 0.0125 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 08 Name of the land: -; Present Land Use: Road; Claimant: State; Original claimant: M.N.M. Bandarathilaka, No.488, Nawala Road, Rajagiriya; Extent: 0.0014 Hectare.\n\n05. Lot No. 09 Name of the land: Diyawanna Kumbura, Assessment No. 58/6G, Pasal Mawatha; Present Land Use: Home garden; Claimant: State; Original claimant: M. N. M. Bandarathilaka, No. 488, Nawala Road, Rajagiriya, D. M. Liyanage, 58/06 G, Pasal Mawatha, Nawala, Rajagiriya; Extent: 0.0059 Hectare.\n\n06. Lot No. 10 Name of the land: Diyawanna Kumbura, Assessment No. 58/6C, Pasal Mawatha; Present Land Use: Home garden, a permanent building available; Claimant: State;\n\nG 31100 - 37 (2019/09) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 07\n\nMy No.: GCF/ATH/NG/08/LR. Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No:03J/91/LRB/91.\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the land described below under Greater Colombo Flood Control and Environment Promotion Project."
