    "chunk_text": "17. Lot No. 21 Name of the land: Diyawanna Kumbura, Assessment No. 58/8, Pasal Mawatha; Present Land Use: Home garden; Claimant: State; Original claimant: M. N. M. Bandarathilaka, No.488, Nawala Road, Rajagiriya, S. D. Dharmadasa, 58/08, Pasal Mawatha, Nawala, Rajagiriya; Extent: 0.0025 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Sri Lanka Land Reclamation and Development Corporation, No.03, Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha, Welikada, Rajagiriya on 28.10.2019 at 9.30a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16.10.2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nC.W. ABEYSURIYA, Acquiring Officer, Grater Colombo Flood Control Project, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Sri Jayawardhanapura Kotte. Grater Colombo Flood Control Project, Acquiring Officer, No. 03, Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha, Welikada, Rajagiriya. 23.09.2019 10-374\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
