    "chunk_text": "EXCISE ORDINANCE\n\nExcise Notification No. 05/2019\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4, 13 and 17 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), I, Mangala Samaraweera,Minister of Finance, do hereby declare that, with effect from September 27, 2019.\n\n(1)The limit of sale of foreign liquor by retail, with respect to the whole Island shall be 80 (Eighty) Bulk Litres; and\n\n(2)The maximum quantity for transport and possession of foreign liquor for the bona fide private consumption or usewithout a pass issued under the Ordiance with respect to the whole Island shall be 80 (Eighty) Bulk Litres.\n\nThe Excise Notification, No. 985 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1947/41 of December 31, 2015 is herebyrescinded.\n\nMANGALA SAMARAWEERA,\n\nMinister of Finance.\n\nMinistry of Finance,Colombo 01,27th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 510\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2142$77 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 27 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'09'27\n\nNo. 2142/77 - FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 27, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.1A - PG 4659 - 592 (2019/09)"
